From 1672ce9c4fa902f9732e04f35b6986a76e6b7678 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jukka Aho <ahojukka5@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 02:35:54 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] prov/cxi: add error-path event diagnostics

Diagnostic only, not for merge. Copy each handled CXI event into a
per-thread ring and, when an event carries an unexpected return code or a
send/receive request completes in error, print the raw event, the request
state and the recent ring to stderr. Normal completions print nothing.

Signed-off-by: Jukka Aho <ahojukka5@gmail.com>
---
